      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a professional email to one of our suppliers? We just got the invoice for the resin shipment from last week, but the quantity billed doesn't match the packing slip. We ordered 500kg but they charged us for 650kg. I need to ask them for a credit memo and an explanation for why there's a discrepancy. Keep it firm but professional so we don't hurt the relationship. Thanks.",
