      "role": "user",
      "content": "That looks good, thanks. Can you make it a bit more formal though? Maybe add a line about how we need this resolved before the end of the current billing cycle so it doesn't mess up our internal audits. Also, just a quick check, do you think it's worth mentioning that our warehouse manager was pretty confused when he saw the discrepancy on the floor? Just to show it wasn't just a clerical error on our end.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
