      "content": "Subject: Formal Inquiry Regarding Invoice [Invoice Number] - Resin Shipment Discrepancy\n\nDear [Supplier Contact Name],\n\nWe are writing to formally address a discrepancy identified on Invoice [Invoice Number] pertaining to the recent resin shipment. Our records indicate an order quantity of 500kg, whereas the invoice reflects a charge for 650kg. We require a detailed explanation for this variance and request that a corresponding credit memo be issued promptly. To ensure compliance with our internal auditing procedures, we must have this matter resolved before the close of the current billing cycle.\n\nRegarding the receipt, our warehouse manager noted the discrepancy upon physical inspection, confirming it is not an error on our end. We trust this can be rectified swiftly, as we value our ongoing business relationship with your company.\n\nSincerely,\n\n[Your Name]",
