      "role": "user",
      "content": "Perfect, that's exactly the tone I was looking for. One more thing—could you suggest a follow-up if they don't reply within 3 business days? Just a shorter, slightly more urgent note to nudge them. Also, has anyone else ever run into these kinds of weird, random quantity errors with suppliers before? It's so strange how things just don't add up sometimes.",
